claude: true
prompt: |
  Drain the WWW-Forgejo karr board. This is the synchronous LWP-based Forgejo
  API v1 client and the semantics owner for the async sibling Net::Async::Forgejo
  (../p5-net-async-forgejo), with which it is released together. Delegate
  behavior-relevant code to the www-forgejo-worker agent and release audits to
  www-forgejo-release-checker; follow .claude/rules/www-forgejo-rules.md. Never
  release. Cross-repo work is a ticket on the other repo's board, never a direct
  edit.
